+# Live projectile-effect culling profile (2026-10-20)
+
+Both runs used the Release client, SDL3 offscreen, Mesa OpenGL 4.3 (`NVE7`),
+640x480, the same NAP-only application and manifest, and
+`--new-game --invulnerable=on --render-profile-capture=on`. The active manifest
+contains 14 packages; every archive was checked against its manifest size and
+SHA-256, its internal content version was compared, and `nexus-pack verify`
+passed. All NAP inputs are under `Data/NAP/`; the app directory had no loose
+`DATA` or `data` directory. See [`active.json`](active.json) and the runtime
+logs.
+
+Patch 2482 recorded the behavior before dynamic bounds. Its 300-frame CSV had
+7,421 projectile-effect cull candidates and no finite bounds or culls. Patch
+2483 added conservative bounds from current live particles for supported
+billboard, rectangle, beam and nested particle appearances. Unknown appearances,
+non-finite values, and nesting deeper than 16 levels remain visible.
+
+| Metric | Static-bound run | Live-particle-bound run |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| Frames | 300 | 300 |
+| Projectile-effect candidates, total | 7,421 | 6,261 |
+| Candidates with finite cull bounds, total | 0 | 5,954 |
+| Effects culled, total | 0 | 977 |
+| Transparent projectile draw calls, p50 / p95 | 41 / 210 | 35 / 194 |
+| Transparent GPU pass, p50 | 5.259 ms | 4.706 ms |
+| FPS, p50 | 10.83 | 10.80 |
+
+The bounds counters satisfy `culled <= finite bounds <= candidates` in every
+frame. The dynamic run confirms the new path produces bounds and rejects
+outside effects. Each rejected count is one effect instance; it is not a count
+of GPU draw calls. These were separate, moving new-game runs without a fixed
+camera or deterministic projectile sequence. Their draw-call and GPU-time
+medians therefore do not establish an FPS or GPU-time improvement. Visual
+comparison on fixed frames and a controlled before/after capture remain open.
+
+## Artifacts
+
+- [Profile before live-particle bounds](static-bounds-frame-profile.csv)
+- [Profile with live-particle bounds](particle-bounds-frame-profile.csv)
+- [Static-bound runtime log](static-bounds-runtime.log)
+- [Live-particle-bound runtime log](particle-bounds-runtime.log)
+- [Active NAP manifest](active.json)
